cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RoboTwin-Plus in your research, please cite this repository as well as the upstream RoboTwin 2.0 and LIBERO-Plus works listed below."
title: "RoboTwin-Plus: Robustness Testing for VLA Policies via Structured Perturbations"
abstract: >-
  RoboTwin-Plus extends the RoboTwin 2.0 bimanual manipulation platform with
  LIBERO-Plus-style structured perturbation categories (objects, background,
  lighting, camera, robot state, language, sensor noise) for systematically
  evaluating the robustness of Vision-Language-Action policies.
